      `📈 *REVENUE:* Rp ${currentMTDRevenue.toLocaleString()} (${mtdAchv}%)\n` +
      `💸 *TOTAL EXPENSES:* Rp ${grandTotalExpense.toLocaleString()} (${calcRatio(grandTotalExpense)}%)\n` +
      `📋 *QA SCORE:* ${outletAvg}%\n` +
      `⭐ *RATING:* ${currentRating} ★\n` +
      `👤 *STAFF MENTIONS:* ${totalMentions}\n` +
      `⚠️ *COMPLAINTS:* ${complaints.length} Cases (${resolvedCount} Res)\n\n` +
