            </h3>
            <div className="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
               <div className="text-center">
                  <div className="text-5xl font-black text-white print:text-black leading-none">{currentRating}</div>
                  <div className="text-[10px] font-black text-slate-500 uppercase mt-3 tracking-widest">Average ★</div>
